  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ANKARA-ICMPS-KIRKAYAK KULTUR SANAT VE DOGA DERNEGI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve access to and retention in education for Dom children aged 6&#x2013;10 living in the &#x15e;irinevler neighbourhood of Gaziantep. Psychosocial art workshops will be organised for the children, and awareness-raising training sessions will be held for teachers and school administrators. Families will also receive training on hygiene, nutrition, and the prevention of domestic violence. The project seeks to reduce absenteeism, encourage positive behaviour and discipline, and foster an inclusive and supportive school environment.</narrative>
  </description>
